### Get all customers (paginated response: content, page, size, totalElements, totalPages)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/customers

### Create a new customer
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com"
}

### Create another customer
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Smith",
  "email": "john.smith@mail.com"
}

### Get a customer by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/customers/1

### Update a customer by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/v1/customers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe Updated",
  "email": "john.doe.updated@example.com"
}

### Delete a customer by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/customers/1

### Get all customers after deletion
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/customers

### Get a customer by ID that does not exist
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/customers/999

### Create a customer with non unique email
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate Email",
  "email": "john.doe@mail.com"
}

### Get a customer by an invalid (non-positive) ID
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/customers/0
